  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserverminer.com%252fcurse%252fspace-astronomy-2-server-hosting\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/31d0bbf887ffe0cb6dd81730e8f6f20b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"680\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>通过我们的合作伙伴 ServerMiner 一键创建属于你自己的 Space Astronomy 2 服务器：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserverminer.com%252fcurse%252fspace-astronomy-2-server-hosting\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>，使用优惠码 MJRLegends 可享八折优惠。无需任何技术知识，即可即时搭建！</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本整合包已停止支持/更新，敬请谅解</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Space Astronomy 2&nbsp;</strong>是一款太空主题整合包，包含了大量最新的科技与太空模组。借助内置的成就引导书，你将逐步了解所需完成的步骤，探索浩瀚宇宙。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<h3><strong>漏洞信息：</strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>整合包 V1.5.7 及以下版本包含 BiblioCraft：请查看漏洞详情：<em> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252ffeedthebeast%252fcomments%252fyfe57z%252f17_112_bibliocraft_oversight_allows_writing_nbt%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.reddit.com/r/feedthebeast/comments/yfe57z/17_112_bibliocraft_oversight_allows_writing_nbt/</a>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fblog%252fmitigating-bibliocraft-rce%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.creeperhost.net/blog/mitigating-bibliocraft-rce/</a></em></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><em>已修复版本（模组已被移除）：v1.5.9（及以上版本）</em></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><br>整合包 V1.5.7 及以下版本包含 EnderCore/EnderIO 及 BDLib：请查看漏洞详情：<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblog.mmpa.info%252fposts%252fbleeding-pipe\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://blog.mmpa.info/posts/bleeding-pipe</a><br></em></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><em>已修复版本（模组已更新）：v1.5.9（及以上版本）</em></strong></h3>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><strong><em>请自行查阅相关资料后谨慎使用本整合包，风险自负！</em></strong></h3>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>内存需求：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>客户端：</strong></p>\n<p>最低（整合包启动时）：3840MB</p>\n<p>推荐/可流畅游玩：4352MB 及以上（取决于你的世界进度）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>服务器：</strong></p>\n<p>最低：即将更新</p>\n<p>推荐：即将更新</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><strong>你可以在<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/space-astronomy-2/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>或整合包主菜单中找到服务器文件！</strong></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>注意：如有任何 Bug 或问题，请向<a href=\"https://github.com/MJRLegends/Space-Astronomy-2-Feedback-/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>反馈！</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>更新日志 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpastebin.com%252fsT3e0wLd\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击查看</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>问题追踪 - <a href=\"https://github.com/MJRLegends/Space-Astronomy-2-Feedback-/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击查看</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>已知问题 - <a href=\"https://github.com/MJRLegends/Space-Astronomy-2-Feedback-/issues/99\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击查看</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>模组列表 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpastebin.com%252f8uF9P9jh\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击查看</a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>如何在 Curse/Twitch App 中更改 Minecraft 的内存分配/使用？&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.mjrlegends.com%252fGeneral%2bMinecraft%252fram%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.mjrlegends.com/General%20Minecraft/ram/</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>如何在 Curse/Twitch App 中的 Minecraft 找到崩溃日志？&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.mjrlegends.com%252fGeneral%2bMinecraft%252fcrash-log%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.mjrlegends.com/General%20Minecraft/crash-log/</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>如何在新版 Twitch App 中安装 Space Astronomy 1 &amp; 2？<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fCYxre\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://imgur.com/a/CYxre</a> </strong></p>\n<p><strong>如何在新版 Twitch App 中游玩整合包？<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fcBNZs\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://imgur.com/a/cBNZs</a> </strong></p>\n<p><strong>如何下载 Space Astronomy 2 的服务器文件？&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.m